Package: vkq3ng
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: kubuntugamer <kubuntugamer@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgl1, libglx0, libopengl0, libx11-6, libxext6, libsm6, libice6, libxxf86vm1, libxxf86dga1, libpipewire-0.3-0t64 | libpipewire-0.3-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libxkbcommon0, libvulkan1
Homepage: https://github.com/kubuntugamer/vkq3ng
Description: Vulkan Quake III Arena engine with native Wayland and RTX
 A Linux-focused continuation of vkq3ng, the Vulkan and ray-tracing fork
 of Quake III Arena.  It provides native Wayland windowing, PipeWire
 audio, cross-vendor KHR ray tracing, DLSS, FSR2, EASU, and NVIDIA Reflex.
 .
 This package contains the engine binaries and the CC0 blue-noise
 textures required by the RTX renderer.  Quake III Arena data files and
 third-party texture packs are not included.
